# Shopify ERP integration rules

Phase **1**: **READ-ONLY** sync + webhook ingestion + theme **draft** scaffolding. **Forbidden** unless explicitly directed: Shopify Admin write mutations (`productUpdate`, inventory adjustments, draft order edits, theme publish/upload), except saving **local mirrored files** during development.

Phase **2** scaffolding (allowed now): configs, enums, guarded placeholder listeners/jobs—not production write paths.

---

## Communication & API surface

| Rule | Enforcement |
| --- | --- |
| **Backend-only** Shopify Admin calls | Tokens never shipped to SPA; never `env()` in frontend bundles |
| **GraphQL Admin API default** | Use `POST …/admin/api/{VERSION}/graphql.json`; avoid REST unless justified inline in PR |
| **`SHOPIFY_API_VERSION`** from env default (stable pinned) | Update deliberately; document changelog |
| **Timeouts + retries + jitter** | Wrap HTTP with `retry()` + sane connect timeout |

---

## Secrets & webhook security

Env: `SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN`, `SHOPIFY_CLIENT_ID`, `SHOPIFY_CLIENT_SECRET`, `SHOPIFY_API_VERSION`, `SHOPIFY_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, optional `SHOPIFY_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI` / `SHOPIFY_OAUTH_SCOPES`. Persisted OAuth Admin token rows live in `shopify_oauth_installations` (never expose to SPA). Install via `GET /shopify/oauth/install` then callback `GET /shopify/oauth/callback` (see `docs/shopify-integration/oauth.md`).

Webhook rules:

1. **`X-Shopify-Hmac-Sha256` validation** mandatory using **raw POST body**.
2. Reject (**401**) invalid signatures immediately.
3. **Log failures** (`shopify` channel + **`shopify_webhook_logs.verification_error`** text — e.g. `invalid_hmac`, `missing_webhook_secret`).
4. Never expose token in payloads/logs.

Ingress route lives at **`POST /api/webhooks/shopify`** and **must bypass** `ExternalAccessPasswordMiddleware` / `ShopifyImagesOnlyMiddleware` (already aligned in codebase—preserve when editing middleware).

---

## Architecture placement

Place code under **`App\Services\Shopify\Admin\`** orchestrating sync pulls; **`App\Contracts\Shopify\`** interfaces for HTTP client; webhook controller under **`App\Http\Controllers\Api\`** or `\Shopify\` namespace—**thin** (<40 LOC methods) delegating to services.

Separate from legacy helpers (`CloudflaredTunnel`, image signing) treating them as orthogonal concerns unless PR explicitly merges.

---

## Sync discipline

Requirements for every runnable sync pathway:

| Must | Detail |
| --- | --- |
| **Idempotent** | Upsert keyed by Shopify **GID** unique indexes |
| **Pagination** | Follow GraphQL `pageInfo.endCursor` until `hasNextPage` false |
| **Retries** | HTTP retries for transport; job-level retries optional |
| **Resume-friendly** | Store `checkpoint_json`/`cursor_hint` columns on sync logs when iterative |
| **Observability** | Persist **`shopify_sync_logs`** counters + status + durations + condensed error blobs |

Prefer **distinct sync services/methods** per entity staying under **`services.mdc`** sizing guidance; Coordinator sequences them.

Mirror tables **`shopify_*`** remain normalized; **`payload_json`** optional raw GraphQL fragments for auditing (truncate huge responses if needed Phase 2).

---

## Themes / Liquid workflow

Liquid/source of truth mirrors live under **`themes/shopify-draft/`** in git (**draft only**).

| Allowed Phase 1 | Forbidden Phase 1 |
| --- | --- |
| Local folder scaffolding, lint hooks later, README workflows | Automated theme publish, `themeFilesUpsert`, production push scripts |

Humans approve deploys externally (Shopify admin / CI) Phase 2+.

---

## Phase control & approvals

| Status | Behaviour |
| --- | --- |
| Phase **1** | Only read queries + ingest webhooks logging + enqueue events |
| Phase **2** | Introduce mutations only behind explicit specs + approvals + guarded jobs |

Dangerous mutations require human approval workflows—document placeholders with `PHASE 2:` comments.

